ElektraWatt third-party notices
================================

This file lists third-party material committed to this repository. The notices of third-party Rust crates are
generated per release with cargo-about (about.toml, ci/third-party-notices.hbs).

Bundled fonts (assets/fonts/, ADR-0028)
---------------------------------------

Noto Sans and Noto Sans Math are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1); the
licence text is LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt. The files are unmodified copies of static unhinted TrueType files and
are pinned by SHA-256 in crates/ew-text (ADR-0028 recommendation 6); Noto Sans SemiBold, a face of the user
interface only (WP-S2.17), is pinned in crates/ew-ui. The three Noto Sans files are the instances of the upstream repository at the commit named in each Source URL (the repository publishes no
release tags). Noto Sans Math is not a raw commit file: it is the file at the path named under "Source"
inside the notofonts release asset NotoSansMath-v3.000.zip. Noto Sans Math is the symbol fallback face
(ADR-0028 recommendation 3).
Noto is a trademark of Google Inc. (font name table entry 7); the trademark line is reproduced here as the
OFL-1.1 requires for redistributed copies (decision ID-51).

