SQLite (bundled by the libsqlite3-sys crate)
--------------------------------------------

The libsqlite3-sys crate bundles SQLite's C source, which is compiled into ElektraWatt; the release's SBOM names its
version, read from the bundled sqlite3.h. SQLite is in the public domain, which sqlite3.h states as:

  The author disclaims copyright to this source code.  In place of
  a legal notice, here is a blessing:

     May you do good and not evil.
     May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
     May you share freely, never taking more than you give.
